      "thought": "Keep the parent\u2019s captured lead, side-seed balance, and pit mobility signals; raise the captured lead slightly and normalize the seed signal by the total seeds.",
      "source": "def evaluate_state(state_view, player_id):\n    start = player_id * 6\n    other = (1 - player_id) * 6\n    board = state_view.board\n    own = board[start:start + 6]\n    opp = board[other:other + 6]\n    store_lead = state_view.captured[player_id] - state_view.captured[1 - player_id]\n    side_lead = sum(own) - sum(opp)\n    total = sum(own) + sum(opp)\n    mobility = (1 if own[0] > 0 else 0) + (1 if own[1] > 0 else 0) + (1 if own[2] > 0 else 0) + (1 if own[3] > 0 else 0) + (1 if own[4] > 0 else 0) + (1 if own[5] > 0 else 0)\n    other_mobility = (1 if opp[0] > 0 else 0) + (1 if opp[1] > 0 else 0) + (1 if opp[2] > 0 else 0) + (1 if opp[3] > 0 else 0) + (1 if opp[4] > 0 else 0) + (1 if opp[5] > 0 else 0)\n    score = 2.8 * store_lead + 0.18 * side_lead / (1 + total) + 0.22 * (mobility - other_mobility)\n    return max(-10.0, min(10.0, score / 3.0))",
